        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: \"Slow Turning\", \"Drive South\", \"Voices in the Wind\"\n- People: John Hiatt, Dennis Quaid, John Lee Hancock\n- Films: The Rookie (2002 film)\n- Companies: Walt Disney Pictures\n- Albums: Slow Turning\n\nFacts:\n- In 1988, John Hiatt recorded \"Drive South\" on his album \"Slow Turning\".\n- \"Drive South\" was written by John Hiatt.\n- A cover of John Hiatt's \"Drive South\" became the No. 2 single from \"Voices in the Wind\" and earned her a second straight gold record.\n- The 2002 film \"The Rookie\" is a sports drama directed by John Lee Hancock and produced by Walt Disney Pictures.\n- Dennis Quaid starred in the 2002 motion picture drama \"The Rookie\".\n- The single \"Slow Turning\" was featured in the 2002 film \"The Rookie\".",
